# Portal version 3: restore_token in the reply is ignored, obs_source_save is not called, persist_mode not sent.
unique_name :1.5
prop ScreenCast AvailableSourceTypes "uint32 1"
prop ScreenCast version "uint32 3"
screencast_load
set a RestoreToken str stored-A
new a pipewire-desktop-capture-source
response 1 "(0, {'session_handle': <'/s/a'>})"
response 2 "(0, {})"
response 3 "(0, {'streams': <[(@u 1, @a{sv} {})]>, 'restore_token': <'ignored'>})"
get a RestoreToken str
save a
settings_json a
